#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000006
msgid "Why don't you ask her yourself... Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000007
msgid "Jack...."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000008
msgid "What..?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000009
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001a
msgid "Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000000
msgid "Come on, Snake! Or should I say, Big Boss? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000001
msgid ""
"That filthy title given you as reward for murder...\n"
"Do you still wear it with pride?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000002
msgid ""
"You chose a shadowy \"country\" over the mentor\n"
"who made you what you are. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000003
msgid "You brought despair to good soldiers everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000004
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \n"
"to kill a true hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000005
msgid "Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000000
msgid "And that's the way a soldier's supposed to think?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000006
msgid ""
"The only thing we can believe in \n"
"with absolute certainty..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000007
msgid "...is the mission, Jack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000000
msgid "I taught you all I could."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000001
msgid "The rest you needed to learn on your own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000002
msgid ""
"Techniques, sure.\n"
"But what about how to think like a soldier?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a saying in the Orient: \"Loyalty to \n"
"the end\"... Do you know what it means?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000001
msgid "Being... patriotic?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000002
msgid "It means devoting yourself to your country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000000
msgid "I'm defecting to the Soviet Union."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000001
msgid "Jack, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000002
msgid "you can't come with us."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"As long as we have \"loyalty to the end,\" \n"
"there's no point in believing in anything..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000001
msgid "even in those we love."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000000
msgid "How's the horse doing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000001
msgid ""
"Not too bad. You'd never know \n"
"he was over 20 years old."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000002
msgid "He was hers, after all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000003
msgid "Seems like some part of her became a part of him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000004
msgid "The platform and the cerebral AI"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000005
msgid ""
"are supposed to be assembled at \n"
"an underground base disguised as a mine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000000
msgid "If my guess is right, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000001
msgid ""
"both of them have already arrived \n"
"and are being readied for final testing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000002
msgid "Destroying the platform will be difficult. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000003
msgid ""
"I suggest getting up close \n"
"and destroying the AI instead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000004
msgid "Whatever you do, I'm begging you, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000005
msgid ""
"don't let my Peace Walker launch a nuke.\n"
"Hurry, Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000000
msgid "That supposed to be an offer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000001
msgid "I'm not offering anything."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000002
msgid ""
"If I'm to sell my new system, \n"
"you and yours have got to go."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000003
msgid "Wait! Coldman, I have questions for him"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000004
msgid ""
"information critical to the completion\n"
"of the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000005
msgid "Give him to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000006
msgid "Hmph... Don't waste too much time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000007
msgid ""
"We've just received word that \n"
"the SALT-II talks are on schedule."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000008
msgid "We will launch on time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000009
msgid "Snake, you are going to help me resurrect her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x00000a
msgid "Shut up! The Boss is dead!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000000
msgid "Initiate."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000001
msgid "What's the situation?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"We're waiting on acknowledgement from Reptile.\n"
"It could be a while."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000003
msgid "Don't take all night."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000004
msgid "Oh, Coldman, I'd like to perform one final check."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000005
msgid "Everyone, take a break."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"I've got some concerns about \n"
"the dummy data for Mammal..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000007
msgid "Now's your chance, Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000000
msgid ""
"Mammal showed the same \n"
"response back at the lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000001
msgid "It's a sure sign that you are nearby."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000002
msgid "It's an honor to meet you again, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000003
msgid "I've seen that coyote before."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000004
msgid "Lobo is the name."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000005
msgid "Lobo? Smells like a rotting corpse to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000000
msgid "No, machines don't make mistakes. Only men do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000001
msgid "That's why a fully automated, mechanized deterrent like Peace Walker is needed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000002
msgid ""
"Once our system is embraced, Langley will again\n"
"turn its attention to Latin America"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000003
msgid "as the cockpit of the new Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000004
msgid "Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000005
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will be deployed along \n"
"Central America's entire Caribbean coast."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000006
msgid ""
"All of North America, South America,\n"
"and the West Indies will be within its range."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000007
msgid "We'll bring law and order to the entire continent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000008
msgid "And you'll still be calling the shots."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000009
msgid "Hmph. ...You still don't get it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000a
msgid ""
"The age of heroes is over, buried alongside\n"
"The Boss and her bankrupt beliefs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000b
msgid "From now on, our only heroes will be machines."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000c
msgid "Surely no one understands that better than you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000d
msgid "Except perhaps your partner."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000e
msgid "A deterrent for hire. An army without borders."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"You've invented a new system, too,\n"
"and an admirable one at that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000000
msgid ""
"I know all about you. \n"
"Tselinoyarsk? Ten years ago?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000001
msgid "You were involved...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000002
msgid ""
"The operation to eliminate the traitor?\n"
"I planned the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000003
msgid "Shouldn't a suit like you be back at Langley?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000004
msgid "What the hell are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000005
msgid "...It's what the CIA does best."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000006
msgid ""
"Ensure people in the know keep \n"
"their mouths shut,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000007
msgid ""
"or else pack them off someplace \n"
"where there's no one to listen."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000008
msgid ""
"I get it. Trying to claw \n"
"your way back into their good graces... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000009
msgid "It's not quite that simple."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000a
msgid "My aim is... a new world order."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Détente, \n"
"the NPT (Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty),"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000c
msgid ""
"SALT (Strategic Arms Limitation Talks),\n"
"TTBT (Threshold Test Ban Treaty)..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000d
msgid "Ever since the Cuban Missile Crisis,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000e
msgid ""
"the structure of the Cold War has been\n"
"coming apart at the seams."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000f
msgid "A new age is dawning."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000010
msgid "An age in which Peace Walker,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000011
msgid ""
"an infallible nuclear deterrent system\n"
"with the patience and cold logic of a machine,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000012
msgid "will play a vital role."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000013
msgid ""
"That's your plan? Assigning \n"
"humanity's sins to a bunch of machines?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000014
msgid "Hmph. Quite the romantic."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x62815b/0x000000
msgid "Bring him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000000
msgid ""
"Remember the Cuban Missile Crisis,\n"
"when the commander of a Russian sub"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000001
msgid "refused an order to launch a nuclear-armed torpedo at an American destroyer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000002
msgid ""
"In retrospect, that man was a hero.\n"
"He saved the world from all-out nuclear war."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000003
msgid "Humans are incapable of destroying themselves."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000004
msgid "...But an AI wouldn't hesitate to push the button."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000005
msgid "Precisely. Making it the one real deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000006
msgid "People hesitate, lose their nerve."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000007
msgid ""
"Isn't that why deterrence theory \n"
"works in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000000
msgid "...Jack, you've returned."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000001
msgid "What's wrong? Your body temperature has fallen."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000002
msgid "... You're imagining things."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000003
msgid "Have you come to destroy me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000004
msgid "Your pulse has quickened slightly."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000005
msgid "Just chilly. It's freezing in here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000006
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000008
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000b
msgid "What is it, Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000009
msgid "Boss?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000a
msgid "Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000c
msgid "Do you have..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000d
msgid "regrets?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000e
msgid "Regrets?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000f
msgid "About your final mission."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000010
msgid "My final mission?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000011
msgid "The one in Groznyj Grad."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000012
msgid "I've... never been on a mission there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000013
msgid "September, 1964... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000014
msgid "You betrayed the United States... and then..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000015
msgid "I killed you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000016
msgid "I have no record of such a debriefing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000017
msgid "...Listen to me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000018
msgid ""
"I have to know, did you defect to \n"
"the Soviet Union of your own free will?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000019
msgid ""
"There is no mission record \n"
"matching that description."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001b
msgid "You're not The Boss. The Boss is dead!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001c
msgid "Don't do it, Jack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001d
msgid "Drop your weapon, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe0d/0x4281da/0x000001
msgid "Take him away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000000
msgid "I didn't defect."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000001
msgid "I'm loyal... to the end, to my purpose."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000002
msgid "What about you, Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000003
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000004
msgid ""
"Your country, or your old mentor?\n"
"Your mission, or your beliefs?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000005
msgid "Your duty to your unit, or your personal feelings?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000000
msgid ""
"...You hate me? Fine. Turn it up.\n"
"It doesn't change the fact that I killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000001
msgid ""
"I know that... \n"
"But what I don't know is your motive."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000002
msgid ""
"Why would a hero - loyal to the end -\n"
"betray her country?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000003
msgid "What really happened?! What did you see?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000004
msgid ""
"...She betrayed more than just her country.\n"
"She betrayed me, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your Boss defected from the U.S.\n"
"taking a Davy Crockett with her, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000001
msgid ""
"and used it to launch a nuclear \n"
"strike on Soviet territory. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000002
msgid ""
"That much I know from \n"
"the CIA's official debriefing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000003
msgid "...Did she defect or not?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000004
msgid ""
"Answer me! Did she or did she not die \n"
"for her country?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000005
msgid ""
"...She sold us out. \n"
"My orders were to take care of her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000006
msgid "Liar! I want to know the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000007
msgid "Brace yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x504352/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000007
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000000
msgid "Then how do you explain that bandana?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000001
msgid "Why keep a memento of a traitor...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000002
msgid "...What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000003
msgid "And what about that scar?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000004
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you have the same scars\n"
"by sheer coincidence!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000005
msgid "DON'T touch me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000006
msgid "Decorating your body with her memory..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000007
msgid "Rather effeminate if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000000
msgid ""
"Would you see your beloved Boss \n"
"brought back to life?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000001
msgid "Then say it. Say she died for America!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000002
msgid "That she remained true to the end, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000003
msgid ""
"gave her life for the country that \n"
"betrayed her time and again!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000004
msgid "...No..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000005
msgid "...That woman..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000006
msgid "...was a traitor!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000b7
msgid "Rise and shine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000001
msgid ""
"Coldman's greed does not concern me.\n"
"I'm only interested in one thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000002
msgid "The truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist - an AI developer. \n"
"But not an AI myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist. And as a scientist, \n"
"I find this distasteful."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000005
msgid ""
"You understand? I am a scientist \n"
"and I expect answers that make sense."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000006
msgid "Now, what do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000000
msgid "Why... For what purpose...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000001
msgid "...She went to her grave cursing her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000002
msgid "Why?! Who is it?! What are you protecting?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000003
msgid "I'm not helping you finish that thing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000004
msgid ""
"Face it! The Boss is dead! Whatever's\n"
"inside that machine, it isn't her!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'm raising the voltage. \n"
"The next one might kill you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000000
msgid ""
"Admit it! She sacrificed her life for America,\n"
"didn't she?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000001
msgid ""
"Sacrificed all for a country that cared nothing\n"
"for her soul or for her dignity. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000002
msgid "And you...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000003
msgid ""
"Yes, I do hate you.\n"
"But even you must understand how I feel. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000004
msgid "I have a right to know what she died for!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000005
msgid ""
"Why won't you tell me?\n"
"You're no longer one of Washington's lapdogs. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000006
msgid "You have no moral obligation to your country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000000
msgid "Why... Why not just give up...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000001
msgid "He's passed out..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe2325e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x10325f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x10825f/0x000000
msgid "A power failure? Damn it... discontinue."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe23e5e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x103e5f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x108e5f/0x000000
msgid "Something's going on outside."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000000
msgid "...kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00003f
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000010
msgid "Stop it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000004
msgid "kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000003
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001a5
msgid "SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000000
msgid "...You..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000001
msgid "...Take him away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000000
msgid "Ready to talk now?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000001
msgid "I've got nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000002
msgid "I think you do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000003
msgid "Very well, then."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000000
msgid "...Kill me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000001
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000002
msgid "I killed her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000003
msgid "...No, that is not what I want to know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000000
msgid "...Do it... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000001
msgid "kill me... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000002
msgid "kill me now..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000003
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000d
msgid "Stop it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000000
msgid "...She... she betrayed her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000001
msgid "Liar! She's NOT a traitor!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000000
msgid "...I don't understand it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000000
msgid "Now, let's have it. The truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000001
msgid "I've said all I'm gonna say."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000002
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000000
msgid "No, I don't hate you anymore."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000001
msgid "Do it... kill me... I killed her..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000002
msgid "Please, stop... stop it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000003
msgid "I killed her... my beloved... with my own hands..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000004
msgid "Stop it! That's not what happened! You're lying!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x528d86/0x000000
msgid "...Just up the voltage... Kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x928d8b/0x000000
msgid "...OK... All right... the truth..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000000
msgid "I'll grant you that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000001
msgid ""
"But your silence was exactly \n"
"the answer I needed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000002
msgid "Ten years ago, your mission was to kill her. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000003
msgid "And her mission was to be killed by you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000000
msgid "Crops and fish will die, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000001
msgid ""
"leaving plenty of free hands to help us\n"
"mass-produce Peace Walker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000002
msgid "Oho... and wouldn't you know, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000003
msgid ""
"someone's gone and built a pesky little \n"
"fortress there. Now who would do that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000004
msgid "And right in the middle of the target zone, too. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000005
msgid ""
"Oh well. All the better to test the warheads' CEP\n"
"(circular error probability)."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000006
msgid "You bastard..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000000
msgid "It's too late, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000000
msgid "Snake..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000000
msgid "Paz...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000003
msgid ""
"At last I found her. The culprit \n"
"who led you here to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000004
msgid ""
"Should have taken care of her back \n"
"at the supply facility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000005
msgid "Snake, don't..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Mammal Pod is finished.\n"
"Peace Walker's activation sequence is complete."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000007
msgid "Finished...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000008
msgid "With The Boss, you were loyal to the end, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000000
msgid "And the Peace Walker Project is the key."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000001
msgid ""
"The advent of Peace Walker will bring calm\n"
"to this restless world."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000002
msgid ""
"Don't you see, Snake? We need nukes -\n"
"controlled nukes - to have peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000003
msgid "Lies!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000004
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will restore order - \n"
"order in the form of a new Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But if the world is to understand \n"
"the genius of our plan, we must launch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000000
msgid "She fulfilled her duty to America to the very end."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000001
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, Snake, \n"
"the final missing piece is now in place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000000
msgid "I wonder who'll miss a ragtag band of pirates "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000001
msgid "all the way out in the middle of the Caribbean...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000002
msgid "But first..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000003
msgid "We're going to prove to the White House "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000004
msgid ""
"that our baby can travel \n"
"the Caribbean coast on its own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000005
msgid ""
"The whole world will know of \n"
"Peace Walker's versatility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000006
msgid ""
"They'll witness the birth of a deterrent\n"
"that can penetrate both communist "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"and guerilla-controlled territory,\n"
"traverse any kind of terrain..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000008
msgid "And deliver a nuke anywhere it needs to go. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000009
msgid "Untouchable. Unstoppable. The perfect deterrent. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000a
msgid "The Cold War's days are numbered. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Deterrence isn't only about \n"
"America and Russia now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You know what? You're absolutely right.\n"
"While we've been wringing our hands, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000d
msgid "China, France - even India - have surpassed us. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000e
msgid ""
"There's a free-for-all nuclear arms race brewing\n"
"just below the surface."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000f
msgid "The nuclear threat will only spread,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000010
msgid ""
"which is exactly why we must deter it \n"
"here and now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"And thus The Boss is restored to life\n"
"as the Mammal Pod. I thank you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000001
msgid "Restored to life...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000002
msgid "You're crazy."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000003
msgid "I'll let you in on a little secret, Big Boss. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"You see, I've already selected \n"
"Peace Walker's initial target."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000005
msgid "An offshore area in the Caribbean."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The trade winds will scatter the fallout\n"
"all over the surrounding region."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000016
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x902c9e/0x000000
msgid "Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000001
msgid "Stop them, Snake! Don't let 'em get away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000000
msgid "There it is! It's still in range!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000001
msgid "Peace Walker's estimated top speed on level terrain is 25 miles an hour."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000002
msgid "C'mon, I'll bet you can do at least 30."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000003
msgid "Paz is on board the Hind, too. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000004
msgid "I noticed that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000005
msgid "She's our client. We have to protect her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000006
msgid "Snake, don't let Peace Walker get away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000007
msgid "The day is dawning... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000008
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6269fd/0x000000
msgid "Go!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000000
msgid "Approaching the border. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000001
msgid "See you around, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000002
msgid "Holy... Look at that! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000003
msgid "Snake, that's the border up ahead! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x329070/0x000000
msgid "Snake, you're entering the woods. Watch out!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000000
msgid "Peace Walker's getting away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000001
msgid "Faster! We're losing sight of it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000002
msgid "Hit the <I=△> button as fast as you can!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000003
msgid "You're about to lose Peace Walker!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000000
msgid "Hang in there...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000001
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006338
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000000
msgid "Take the gondola west along the river."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000001
msgid ""
"When you reach the northern bank, \n"
"you are in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000002
msgid "I've arranged for a guide to get you close."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000003
msgid "Snake... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000004
msgid "Chico?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000005
msgid "Sorry about the horse. It sure was pretty."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000006
msgid "Life's end... Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000007
msgid "It's almost tragic."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000000
msgid "I've been waiting, Snake, for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000002
msgid "There is nothing more for me to give you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000003
msgid ""
"All that's left for you to take is my life.\n"
"...By your own hand."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000000
msgid ""
"...And that one of their own \n"
"would have to do the job."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000001
msgid ""
"The Boss wouldn't be allowed \n"
"to come back home alive. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000002
msgid "And she wouldn't be allowed to kill herself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000000
msgid "One must die and one must live."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000001
msgid "No victory, no defeat."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000002
msgid "The survivor will carry on the fight."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000003
msgid "The one who survives will inherit the title of Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000004
msgid "Kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000005
msgid "Kill me now..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her life would be ended by \n"
"her most beloved disciple..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000001
msgid "That was the way that the government wanted it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000002
msgid "That was the mission she was given."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000003
msgid "The taint of disgrace will follow her to her grave."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000000
msgid "There's only room for one Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000001
msgid "And one Snake..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000000
msgid "Future generations will revile her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000001
msgid ""
"In America, as a despicable traitor \n"
"with no sense of honor..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000002
msgid ""
"And in Russia, as a monster who unleashed\n"
"a nuclear catastrophe..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000003
msgid ""
"She will go down in official history \n"
"as a war criminal."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000004
msgid "That... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000005
msgid "was her final mission."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000000
msgid ""
"The Boss' defection was a ruse set up\n"
"by the US government."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000001
msgid ""
"But then something happened that \n"
"no one could have predicted."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000002
msgid ""
"Colonel Volgin fired an American-made\n"
"nuclear warhead "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000003
msgid "at Sokolov's research facility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000004
msgid ""
"So the operation itself was greatly \n"
"expanded and revised."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000005
msgid ""
"The authorities in Washington knew that \n"
"in order to prove their innocence "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000006
msgid "they'd have to get rid of The Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've been taken to safety.\n"
"We can't involve them in this any further."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000001
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000002
msgid "They've got their own cause to fight for."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000003
msgid ""
"And Snake... \n"
"Don't forget the bad guys've got Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000004
msgid "I won't."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000005
msgid "We're prepping a few backup units. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"Don't let 'em launch, Snake. \n"
"We're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000000
msgid "Snake, history will never know what she did."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000001
msgid "No one will ever learn the truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000002
msgid "Her story... her debriefing..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000003
msgid "...will endure only in your heart."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000004
msgid "Everything she did, she did for her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000005
msgid ""
"She sacrificed her life and her honor \n"
"for her native land."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000006
msgid "She was a real hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000007
msgid "She was a true patriot."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000000
msgid "Something's not right..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000001
msgid "Gate guard doesn't look too bad... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000002
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000003
msgid "Gonna need some help."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000001
msgid "This is Miller. Loud and clear."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000002
msgid "Got in without a hitch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000003
msgid ""
"Good, there's an airfield on \n"
"the other side of the building -"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000004
msgid ""
"on the northwestern shore of the lake.\n"
"That's where they'll conduct the launch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000005
msgid ""
"There's a communications tower \n"
"in front of you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I'm betting they'll control \n"
"Peace Walker from there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Kaz, they're targeting Mother Base.\n"
"Don't you think you should evacuate?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000008
msgid "Nah... Everybody here believes in you, Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000009
msgid ""
"Alright, fine then.\n"
"I've kinda gotten attached to the place myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x00000a
msgid "What about Amanda and her people?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000001
msgid "...Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000002
msgid "Can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000003
msgid "Si, I can hear you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000004
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000005
msgid "I am not sure. I don't recognize it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000006
msgid "What about Coldman?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000007
msgid ""
"He just left for the control tower...\n"
"Said something about entering the final data."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000000
msgid "There's a skeleton crew manning the base."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000001
msgid ""
"Everyone else is enroute \n"
"to the base in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000002
msgid ""
"Snake, think you can make it \n"
"to that control tower?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000003
msgid ""
"Not sure why, but this place is \n"
"crawling with Russian troops. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000004
msgid "Gonna have to force my way through."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000005
msgid "What the hell's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000006
msgid "Damned if I know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000007
msgid ""
"Get over there quick as you can.\n"
"You're almost there, Snake. Stay steady!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000000
msgid "What is the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000001
msgid "They found me...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000003
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eeb/0x000000
msgid "Kaz?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000004
msgid "Snake, you OK?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000005
msgid "All MSF's ready to move out."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000006
msgid "They're headed your way, on the double."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000007
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000001
msgid "I'm coming, Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000002
msgid ""
"Do not worry about me... I am an angel of peace.\n"
"I will be watching over you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000003
msgid "Here goes nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000001
msgid "Big Boss, you made it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000002
msgid ""
"Too late, though. \n"
"The false data's already in place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000003
msgid "False data?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000004
msgid "That's right. Peace Walker is designed for deterrence - nothing more. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000005
msgid ""
"She is incapable of initiating \n"
"a nuclear attack on her own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000006
msgid ""
"She will only awaken and attack\n"
"when it's time to retaliate. "
msgstr ""
